# CVE-2025-13836: cpython excessive read buffering DoS in http.client (CRITICAL)
# Status: Pending fix in Debian 12 (bookworm) - CVE published 2025-12-XX
# Impact: DoS via excessive read buffering in http.client module
# Package: libpython3.11-minimal, libpython3.11-stdlib, python3.11-minimal v3.11.2-6+deb12u6
# Mitigation:
#   - Rate limiting enabled (SlowAPI: 100 req/min per IP)
#   - Nginx connection limits (client_body_timeout 30s, client_max_body_size 50M)
#   - Monitoring for abnormal memory usage (psutil alerts)
# Risk assessment: HIGH (FastAPI uses http.client internally via uvicorn)
# Next review: 2026-03-03 (weekly check - HIGH priority)
CVE-2025-13836

